{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>Be fruitful and multiply</b> etc. <b>In the waters, and let the fowl multiply on the earth.</b> Why were the animals and beasts not similarly blessed? Lest the beasts of the field multiply against man and he be unable to withstand them. But birds and fish — these fly in the air and these swim in the water."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T23:19:36.574919291Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}